<title>UK: Stakis Q3 hotel occupancy rate down on yr.</title>
<headline>Stakis Q3 hotel occupancy rate down on yr.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1997-07-15</dateline>
<text>
<p>Hotel and leisure group Stakis Plc said on Tuesday its hotels, excluding the Metropole chain, showed an occupancy level of 77.3 percent in the 13 weeks to June 29, down from 78.6 percent in corresponding period last year.</p>
<p>But its average room rate was 53.21 stg, up from 46.85 stg in the third quarter of 1996.</p>
</text>
